; source: project doc-lint fixture
;! # Doc fix input fixture
;!
;! This fixture is the *before* side of the `--doc --fix` round-trip.
;! It contains Markdown style issues that `rumdl` is expected to fix,
;! such as multiple consecutive blank lines inside a doc block.
;!
;! The CDDL source on lines below the doc block must be preserved
;! byte-for-byte by the reverse transform.


;! ### counter
;! Description of the counter rule.


doc_fixture_fix_counter = uint .lt 100